VALUES ('6b222834-dfff-4134-9ffb-1b3fd0f4f8fa', 'NC17.2.MD.10', 2, 'choice', 'Compare categories: how many more or fewer', 'A picture graph shows games sold at a fair. Each picture stands for 1 game. Chess: 14 pictures. Checkers: 9 pictures. Cards: 11 pictures. Dominoes: 6 pictures. Which sentence is true?', '["Cards has 3 more than Chess.","Dominoes has 4 fewer than Checkers.","Checkers has 5 more than Cards.","Chess has 5 more than Checkers."]', 'Chess has 5 more than Checkers.', NULL, 'Chess is 14 and Checkers is 9, and 14 - 9 = 5, so Chess has 5 more than Checkers. The other sentences do not match the counts: Cards (11) has fewer than Chess (14); Checkers is only 3 more than Dominoes; Checkers (9) has fewer than Cards (11).', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"Chess has 5 more than Checkers.","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Chess 14, Checkers 9, Cards 11, Dominoes 6. Checkers 5 more than Cards? 9<11, false. Cards 3 more than Chess? 11<14, false. Chess 5 more than Checkers: 14-9=5, true. Dominoes 4 fewer than Checkers: 9-6=3, false.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-24T08:29:13.669Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
