VALUES ('1bb339a9-af5e-4c94-94a8-9ef60edb9246', 'NC17.4.OA.4', 2, 'numeric', 'Reasoning about primes and factors', 'I am a multiple of 4 and a factor of 40. I am greater than 10 and less than 30. What number am I?', '[]', '20', '20', 'The factors of 40 are 1, 2, 4, 5, 8, 10, 20 and 40. Of these, only 20 is between 10 and 30, and $20 = 4 \times 5$ is a multiple of 4.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"20","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Multiples of 4 in (10,30): 12,16,20,24,28; factors of 40 among them: 20 only.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-28T19:04:15.644Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
