VALUES ('09bedf23-7481-4a89-a48a-737ffdbd1712', 'NC17.4.G.1', 3, 'numeric', 'Parallel and perpendicular sides in shapes', 'The capital letter E is drawn with 4 line segments: 1 tall vertical segment and 3 short horizontal segments, each joined to the vertical one at a square corner. How many pairs of parallel segments are in the letter?', '[]', '3', '3*2/2', 'Only the 3 horizontal segments are parallel to each other. Pairs: top and middle, top and bottom, middle and bottom. That is 3 pairs.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"3","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"The 3 horizontal segments are parallel to each other: pairs = 3 (top-middle, top-bottom, middle-bottom). The vertical one is perpendicular to each.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-24T08:35:45.762Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
