VALUES ('18b3e1b4-1cc2-4de7-82bb-61821cea1943', 'NC17.M1.A-REI.4', 1, 'numeric', 'Solve by taking square roots', 'Solve $x^2 = 49$. What is the positive solution?', '[]', '7', '7', 'Both $7$ and $-7$ square to 49, so the solutions are $x = 7$ and $x = -7$. The positive one is 7.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"7","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"x^2=49, x=±7; positive 7.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-24T03:17:06.130Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
