VALUES ('13c7ce0c-7e93-43cd-9c10-e091f8d1c433', 'NC17.M3.F-TF.2', 1, 'numeric', 'Cosine as the x-coordinate on the unit circle', 'What is the value of $\cos \frac{\pi}{2}$?', '[]', '0', '0', 'The point on the unit circle at an angle of $\frac{\pi}{2}$ radians is $(0, 1)$. Cosine is the x-coordinate, so $\cos \frac{\pi}{2} = 0$.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"0","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"Point at pi/2 is (0,1); cos = x = 0.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-24T08:38:57.032Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
